{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WELCOME TO TELERA</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Telera is a Dice-builder roguelike with an emphasis on quick gameplay rounds, where you can really lose yourself in the flow state. With very simple mechanics, but endless possibilities, Telera is a great way to relax, decompress, roll some dice, and make some big numbers.<br><br>The Rules are simple: You roll six dice, keep at least one, and re-roll the rest. Repeat until all of the dice are kept. To Score points, you need to have kept a 1 and a 4 to qualify, and the rest of your dice are totaled for your score. Get enough points, and you\u2019ve won the level! Sounds easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/a70f09caca9614ebc37145d15b651512.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/f5c9adb5c19cfe3406255ba312a59089.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/886e15d28649c0dad5c68d4983362e83.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/14d15b50ac2a43a557d0069f447863d7.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/378ee52d1a000accbc08659e4ba6f8c6.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/e85aa48b2784c7b1be2f4ba2daf8b20c.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/378ee52d1a000accbc08659e4ba6f8c6.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/14d15b50ac2a43a557d0069f447863d7.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/886e15d28649c0dad5c68d4983362e83.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/f5c9adb5c19cfe3406255ba312a59089.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/a70f09caca9614ebc37145d15b651512.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless looping of levels - play as long as you can survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice can be upgraded to score more points each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 different kinds of dice creates millions of build possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six different Potions can be applied to the dice for various effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Battles test your dice with different qualifying values, and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five Game modes present different spins on the classic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly leaderboards to show the best players\u2019 scores in each game mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >160 'Chievos to unlock and master the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/a70f09caca9614ebc37145d15b651512.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/f5c9adb5c19cfe3406255ba312a59089.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/886e15d28649c0dad5c68d4983362e83.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/14d15b50ac2a43a557d0069f447863d7.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/378ee52d1a000accbc08659e4ba6f8c6.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/e85aa48b2784c7b1be2f4ba2daf8b20c.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/378ee52d1a000accbc08659e4ba6f8c6.webp?t=1768521964\" width=25 height=25 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079370/extras/14d15b50ac2